      "paperId": "6ae5e0d5065fc0b48bd7143a24533512c51dda62",
      "title": "Revolution, Eschatology, and Myth. Religious and Nature Metaphors of Temporality in Swedish Socialist Press in the Years of the Russian Revolutions",
